    "titleText": "Vocabulary",
    "informationTextHTML": "<p><strong>You will learn:</strong></p><ul><li>Holiday activities such as <em>loger</em>, <em>voyager</em>, <em>partir</em>, <em>bronzer</em>, and <em>faire du tourisme</em>.</li><li>Means of transport such as <em>en avion</em>, <em>en train</em>, <em>à vélo</em>, <em>à cheval</em>, and <em>à pied</em>.</li><li>Expressions to talk about the weather and the seasons such as <em>Quel temps fait-il&nbsp;?</em>, <em>Il fait beau</em>, <em>Il y a du soleil</em>, and <em>en été</em>.</li></ul>"
